license: MIT
abstract: "Generates a PDDL domain and a problem instance from an annotated SysML model. The transformation runs as a report template in MSoSA and generates only what the model contains. Requires the profile from the pddl-sysml-profile repository."
keywords:
  - SysML
  - PDDL
  - model transformation
  - automated planning
